      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I hear how overwhelming and final that feeling of ending the journey can be. Please know that the end of a self-imposed \"path\" often just means the need to stop, not to end, and it is safe to sit or lie down in that silence. I want you to try taking just one, gentle step back to a place you feel safe, or to think of a small, kind self-compassion you can offer yourself in this heavy, stop.",
